    <dashboard name='Story 1' type='storyboard'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='478' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='4357' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone fixed-size='135' h='14004' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='5187' />
            <zone h='79979' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='19191'>
              <flipboard active-id='3' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Sifting through the Snow: Cleaning and Exploratory Analysis' captured-sheet='Citibike Image' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='The Digital Sorting Hat: Machine Learning Segment Discovery' captured-sheet='Elbow Curve' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='The Operational X-Ray: Mapping Segment Hubs' captured-sheet='Cluster Map' id='3'>
                    <currentDeltas>
                      <worksheet name='Cluster Map'>
                        <style delta-type='added'>
                          <style-rule element='axis'>
                            <encoding attr='space' class='0' field='[federated.0x48rq50pyw6em1foemd31kvar0d].[Latitude (generated)]' field-type='quantitative' max='5005491.243554377' min='4951867.1145041166' projection='EPSG:3857' range-type='fixed' scope='rows' type='space' />
                            <encoding attr='space' class='0' field='[federated.0x48rq50pyw6em1foemd31kvar0d].[Longitude (generated)]' field-type='quantitative' max='-8198272.7702120878' min='-8256804.1461329497' projection='EPSG:3857' range-type='fixed' scope='cols' type='space' />
                          </style-rule>
                        </style>
                      </worksheet>
                    </currentDeltas>
                    <capturedDeltas />
                  </story-point>
                  <story-point caption='Strategic Logistics &amp; Maintenance Playbook' captured-sheet='' id='4' />
                  <story-point captured-sheet='Dashboard 1' id='5' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='34544' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='79921' x='9154' y='20436'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Story</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Goal</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: We began with 1.1 million records of February 2022 Citi Bike data to identify how winter conditions affect urban mobility.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Early Questions</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: We asked: Is there a significant difference in how subscribers (Members) vs. one-time users (Casual) use the system during sub-zero temperatures?.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Prep</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Rigorous data cleaning was performed to handle mixed-type data and ensure consistency across coordinates and timestamps.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Initial Discovery</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Our exploratory analysis showed that while trip volume is lower in winter, &quot;Member&quot; ridership remains highly consistent, suggesting a strong commuter base.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='71784' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='4' type-v2='text' w='83268' x='7677' y='19917'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1. Strategic Action: The &quot;North-South&quot; Rebalancing</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Insight</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Cluster 0 (Manhattan) shows high-frequency, short-duration &quot;Commuter&quot; behavior, while Cluster 2 (Brooklyn/Queens) displays leisure-oriented &quot;Explorer&quot; patterns.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Action</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Prioritize bike rebalancing in Manhattan commercial hubs during Monday-Friday AM peaks to support the &quot;Commuter&quot; cluster.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Action</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Increase dock availability along the Brooklyn and Queens waterfronts on weekends to accommodate the &quot;Explorer&quot; cluster.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>2. Maintenance Action: The &quot;Cluster 1&quot; Hardware Audit</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Insight</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Cluster 1 represents &quot;Zero-Distance&quot; trips with abnormally high durations, suggesting users are struggling to undock bikes or find working docks.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Action</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Target the specific stations identified in the Cluster 1 hotspots for immediate hardware inspection and dock repair.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>3. Project Limitations &amp; Future Scope</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Seasonality</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: This analysis represents </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>February 2022</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>; results may shift significantly in summer months as weather influences rider endurance.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Data Gaps</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: The current dataset lacks user demographic data (age, income), which limits our ability to build true &quot;persona-based&quot; marketing.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Next Step</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Future iterations should integrate </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>National Weather Service (NOAA)</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> data to predict ridership spikes based on &quot;RealFeel&quot; temperatures.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='33195' id='9' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='22441' x='4528' y='22303'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>To localize the data, I utilized the </run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Courier New'>MAKEPOINT</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> function to transform raw coordinate decimals into spatial objects, allowing for a precise </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Spatial Intersect</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> with NYC neighborhood boundaries.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='57988' hidden='true' id='10' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='63780' y='20747'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Analysis</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Method</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Using </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>K-means Clustering</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> in Python, I segmented 1.1 million records into three behavioral groups.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Evidence</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Elbow Technique</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> identified 3 clusters as the optimal balance between data complexity and operational clarity.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The Result</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>: Trip </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>duration</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> is the key differentiator. &apos;Explorers&apos; (Cluster 2) take significantly longer trips than &apos;Commuters&apos; (Cluster 0), despite both using the same bike infrastructure.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{1D8FE8BA-235A-4A20-9E86-A1F4DAD384CE}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
  <windows saved-dpi-scale-factor='1.25' source-height='37'>
    <window class='dashboard' maximized='true' name='Story 1'>
